# 15 October, evening (plain fence): assets-ssfar4f is built always (146 rows added; specs/ssfar4f.json = ssfar4eu.json
# without the rule "fence"): only its world.dnm and world.dnt differ from assets-ssfar4eu's (1290 level-of-detail groups
# instead of 1567: no three-level fence groups, no quarter-stipple texture; byte for byte the hardware-benchmarked
# world packs of the benchmark variant ssfar4euf0). Every other row unchanged. A run from the ROM
# (build/dc-native-ssfar4f.recipe, --variants ssfar4d,ssfar4bf3: 1209 identical, the 146 new rows from it).
# 16 October (project decision: the infield grass is not super-sampled): the rule "verges" of specs/ssfar4f.json holds only
# the white track-edge strip 6686; the infield grass 6924 and the grey concrete aprons 6664 stay at their plain level
# (1201 level-of-detail groups instead of 1290). Only assets-ssfar4f/world.dnm and world.dnt changed; they were
# 2311832af19c7fcfd2b62bb5191909cd629494483713f1e4f1ac90af650a708d and
# b4b905f06c7668192318521942c31f81e24374a97de8382d39b348d97485e695 (run from the ROM: build/dc-native-grass.recipe).
# 17 October (slot machine reels super-sampled): the rule "reels" of specs/ssfar4f.json (2592, 2720, 2848, the signs'
# switch; 1393 level-of-detail groups instead of 1201). Only assets-ssfar4f/world.dnm and world.dnt changed; they were
# 44aef5ab7b260162abbde24bdc126b2ea4af5eca318e74890deef3f16fd0b519 and
# b4b246d14357835cdb28945a2a9aedae137493f26b62e5acb5814e17dee483c2 (run from the ROM: build/dc-native-slotss.recipe,
# --music --elf --check: 1698 identical, these 2 different).
# 17 October (reels super-sampled by instance): the rule "reels" has "group": "instance": no group, face or binding
# added; the reels' three materials carry the switch depth (52.4203, material word padding[1]) and the renderer sets
# the TSP bit per reel. assets-ssfar4f/world.dnt is again the one before the reels' rule (b4b246d1...), world.dnm that
# one but for those three words (12 bytes); they were 6634dd6f66962f754d55fe52f521f0348fc93048aba1075b2c9a7e1077388280
# and b0319001890c652555b9150a81e3ce0ae3db36da0a68ffbc35ef2b15d0bcaa70 (the recipe's finished steps of
# build/dc-native-slotss.recipe with world_ssfar4f again, build/dc-native-slotss2.recipe: 1698 identical, these 2).
# race_script_data.h: its format comment now documents edges bit2 (START rising, the slot machine); no table entry
# changed (the fast race presses no START). Was 0a48dee277f7349adf67b80f02cb7978332a5b0350e66d3fd07a2d36984bf417.
